{"sha": "1e9ca86ed9be7cdd89f72e376ecf42bd9944a4afd9aa48b59ee5a59d7191eca7", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "$Z = 4 + 4 = 8$。相邻原子相切：$2R = a\\sqrt3/4$，故 $a =", "8R/\\sqrt3$，且 $C = 8 \\cdot \\frac43\\pi R^3/a^3 = \\frac{32}{3}\\pi R^3 \\cdot", "\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{512 R^3} = \\frac{\\pi\\sqrt3}{16}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{60}{100}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "    \\draw[black!55, line width=1.4pt] (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (0,0,3) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (0,1.5,1.5) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (1.5,0,1.5) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (1.5,1.5,3) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (0,1.5,1.5) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (0,3,0) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (1.5,1.5,0) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (1.5,3,1.5) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,0,1.5) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,1.5,0) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (3,0,0) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (3,1.5,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (1.5,1.5,3) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (1.5,3,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (3,1.5,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (3,3,3);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0.75,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0.75,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (2.25,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (2.25,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={black!65}{3.6mm}] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node at (1.5,1.5,-1.75) {金刚石};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{0.8cm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, y={(0cm,0.45cm)}, z={(0cm,1cm)}, x={(1cm,0cm)}]", "  % two honeycomb layers seen in perspective, ABAB stacking", "  \\foreach \\zz/\\dy/\\col in {0/0/black!40, 1.7/0.82/black!80} {", "    \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2} \\foreach \\j in {0,1} {", "      \\pgfmathsetmacro\\cx{1.42*\\i+0.71*\\j}", "      \\pgfmathsetmacro\\cy{1.23*\\j+\\dy}", "      \\foreach \\k in {0,60,...,300} {", "        \\pgfmathsetmacro\\ka{\\k+60}", "        \\draw[\\col, line width=1pt] ({\\cx+0.82*cos(\\k+30)},{\\cy+0.82*sin(\\k+30)},\\zz)", "          -- ({\\cx+0.82*cos(\\ka+30)},{\\cy+0.82*sin(\\ka+30)},\\zz);", "      }", "    }", "  }", "  \\draw[<->, omThm] (5.6,0.9,0) -- (5.6,0.9,1.7) node[midway, right] {\\qty{335}{pm}};", "  \\node at (2.4,-1.6,0) {石墨};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：金刚石晶胞，每个碳原子与其他四个碳原子成键，排列成四面体。右：石墨，", "由六边形层组成（层内 C--C \\qty{141.8}{pm}），", "层间相距 \\qty{334.8}{pm}，靠伦敦力结合；", "各层以 ABAB 方式交替排列。}", "% ledger: lat:C-graphite.a, lat:C-graphite.c (C-C = a/sqrt3; interlayer = c/2)", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[金刚石、硅、石墨]\\label{ex:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:carbon}", "金刚石的 $a = \\qty{356.7}{pm}$，\\ce{C-C} $= a\\sqrt3/4 =", "\\qty{154.5}{pm}$，即乙烷中的单键，且 $\\rho =", "\\qty{3.52}{g/cm^3}$。硅的结构与之相同，$a =", "\\qty{543.1}{pm}$，\\ce{Si-Si} 键长 $= \\qty{235.2}{pm}$，且 $\\rho =", "\\qty{2.33}{g/cm^3}$（实测为 2.33）。在石墨中，每个碳原子", "与平面内另外三个碳原子成键，键长 \\qty{141.8}{pm}，键级介于一", "与二之间（层上共振），而各层", "之间相距 \\qty{334.8}{pm}。金刚石三维刚性，是最硬的", "天然材料，且为绝缘体；石墨沿层间解理，", "各层易于滑动，层内则借助", "其离域 $\\pi$ 电子导电。", "% ledger: lat:C-diamond, lat:Si, rho:Si, lat:C-graphite.a, lat:C-graphite.c,", "% geo:C2H6.rCC", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.36\\linewidth]{images/book2/graphite.jpg}", "", "{\\small 天然石墨样品，具有金属光泽。照片：", "Zbynek Burival, CC BY-SA 4.0.}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{分子晶体}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分子晶体]\\label{def:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:molecular-crystal}", "由分子借分子间作用力结合而成的晶体，称为", "\\emph{分子晶体}\\index{分子晶体}，分子间作用力为范德华相互作用，", "若可能还有氢键，而各分子保留自身的共价键。", "例如：碘单质、干冰 \\ce{CO2(s)}、冰、糖。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[分子晶体的性质]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:molecular}", "分子晶体质地柔软，在较低温度下熔化或升华，", "因为只需破坏较弱的分子间作用力；它们不导电。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{example}[冰]\\label{ex:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:ice}", "在普通冰中，每个水分子与其他四个分子形成氢键，", "这四个分子位于四面体顶点：其中两个借自身的氢原子，", "另两个借自身的孤电子对形成氢键。这种开放的六方网络，由氢键方向所决定，", "留出大量空隙：冰的密度小于液态", "水，其中网络部分被破坏，分子", "靠得更近。网络的六方对称性体现在", "雪晶的六重形状上。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.38\\linewidth]{images/book2/bentley-snowflakes.jpg}", "", "{\\small 威尔逊·本特利约于 1902 年拍摄的雪晶照片：每一片", "都具有六重对称性，是冰中氢键六方网络", "的痕迹。公有领域。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}